Tower</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/358d312323e0c4ef03b693aa5ab1dde4.avif?t=1786336148\" width=1280 height=170 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/b85fed1fcc7d6a96ad0402c73a4b835d.poster.avif?t=1786336148\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/b85fed1fcc7d6a96ad0402c73a4b835d.webm?t=1786336148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/b85fed1fcc7d6a96ad0402c73a4b835d.mp4?t=1786336148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from among <strong>10 different heroes</strong>, each with distinct abilities reshaping gameplay. Level up, evolve your character through <strong>meta-progression</strong>, and forge your path to the deepest abyss of hell, where you shall confront the ultimate infernal force. Fight through <strong>60 handcrafted levels</strong> set across unique locations, each telling fragments of the story through the world itself - ruins, relics, and the scars of the apocalypse revealing the truth behind the fall of mankind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/5c1f09f54035a9e7412c1670343d7232.avif?t=1786336148\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras_big/5c1f09f54035a9e7412c1670343d7232.avif?t=1786336148 width=1560 height=524 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and merge weapons to forge indestructible builds and seek creative combinations for maximum power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 60 levels across unique locations, with different enemies types and epic bosses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of 10 characters, each with distinct abilities reshaping gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-sculpted 3D characters; visually captivating game with dark and hellish stylized art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs great on Steam Deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for playing with just one hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging yet relaxing auto-shooter experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by a solo developer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/ac3fc13d8c88c0568306eee12b90be7e.poster.avif?t=1786336148\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/ac3fc13d8c88c0568306eee12b90be7e.webm?t=1786336148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/ac3fc13d8c88c0568306eee12b90be7e.mp4?t=1786336148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/1f5d7d07ee2fb5638e7f07047b17bed7.avif?t=1786336148\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras_big/1f5d7d07ee2fb5638e7f07047b17bed7.avif?t=1786336148 width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Jay Studio is co-financed by the European Fund for Smart Economy 2021-2027 as part of the KPT ScaleUp Booster project.</p>", "short_description": "Gear up for a battle through hell in this roguelite Bullet Heaven Arena Autoshooter with Doom-inspired gore vibes, metal music, and a satisfying combat feel. Wield five weapons at once, upgrade and merge them to forge indestructible builds, and bring divine justice to a world on the brink of chaos.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Russian, Thai, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Arms of God represents exactly what the bullet heaven genre needs: genuine evolution. The five-weapon system transforms passive auto-shooting into active build orchestration.”<br>8.5/10 – BulletHaven<br><br>“Even in Early Access, Arms of God already comes surprisingly close to the genre's strongest examples.”<br>10/10 – VGTimes<br><br>“The core combat feels excellent. The weapon and attachment systems are exciting. The gore and presentation give it a strong personality. The meta progression gives it a long-term hook. Most importantly, it understands the delicious moment where you stop feeling threatened and start feeling like the threat.”<br>9/10 – Duuro Plays<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/8dc341ecf4da3efacaa3559ec41012c49e4ac1cc/header.jpg?t=1786336148", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/26d1131ae856201905916eb0c6dca8bc2516981e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786336148", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/26d1131ae856201905916eb0c6dca8bc2516981e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786336148", "website": "https://darkjay.com/armsofgod/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br